        "title": "In many parts of the world, children are given more freedom than in the past. Is this a positive or negative development?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OsVddpi0Lo4oyZxPeQglcEZBg4q\"><em><strong>In many parts of the world, children are given more freedom than in the past. Is this a positive or negative development?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "sort": 1,
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Children's Increased Freedom <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3rMdv4zAo1jGpxg5FYlWXGFggb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Children's Increased Freedom cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Ở nhiều nơi tr&ecirc;n thế giới, trẻ em được cho nhiều tự do hơn so với trước đ&acirc;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0QrdAMv7oilThxPJ5wlCi6mgHp\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một xu hướng t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Children's Increased Freedom v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDdydaFWOoBhJ0x8V5rlxBR8ghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">enjoy considerably more freedom<em> (được hưởng nhiều tự do hơn đ&aacute;ng kể)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JDdydaFWOoBhJ0x8V5rlxBR8ghb\" data-list=\"bullet\">compared to previous generations<em> (so với c&aacute;c thế hệ trước)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực hơn l&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực.&nbsp;</strong>Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; của xu hướng n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B8nVd6ui7oPyVMxWilEloA8Sgfb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, việc cho trẻ em nhiều tự do hơn c&oacute; thể dẫn đến một số hậu quả ti&ecirc;u cực li&ecirc;n quan đến kỷ luật v&agrave; an to&agrave;n.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D85ydGvYPopsOexdQSzlI7Yvggf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BkBXdDtcooR4lqxVdqTl04DTg3e\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Nếu kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; <em>sự hướng dẫn đ&uacute;ng đắn (proper guidance)</em> v&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c quy tắc nghi&ecirc;m ngặt (strict rules)</em>, trẻ em c&oacute; thể gặp kh&oacute; khăn trong việc ph&aacute;t triển <em>t&iacute;nh tự gi&aacute;c (self-discipline)</em> v&agrave; &yacute; thức tr&aacute;ch nhiệm.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BkBXdDtcooR4lqxVdqTl04DTg3e\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Impact: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể dẫn đến những kh&oacute; khăn trong việc tu&acirc;n thủ c&aacute;c quy định ở trường hoặc t&ocirc;n trọng <em>c&aacute;c người c&oacute; thẩm quyền (authority figures)</em> như gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n v&agrave; cha mẹ, điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể cản trở khả năng hoạt động tốt của c&aacute;c em trong m&ocirc;i trường c&oacute; tổ chức.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUm7dcHfLo20hgxySC7lpBHxgjd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTerdTD1hoUGW0xyA5FlzI0qgHf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Core idea 2: </strong>Với nhiều tự do hơn, đặc biệt l&agrave; trong <em>lĩnh vực kỹ thuật số (digital realm),</em> trẻ em c&oacute; thể dễ d&agrave;ng tiếp cận c&aacute;c nội dung c&oacute; hại hoặc <em>kh&ocirc;ng ph&ugrave; hợp với lứa tuổi (age-inappropriate material)</em> tr&ecirc;n mạng.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTerdTD1hoUGW0xyA5FlzI0qgHf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Example: </strong>V&iacute; dụ, c&aacute;c em c&oacute; thể gặp phải c&aacute;c video bạo lực hoặc <em>bắt nạt tr&ecirc;n mạng (cyberbullying) </em>tr&ecirc;n c&aacute;c nền tảng mạng x&atilde; hội m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; <em>sự gi&aacute;m s&aacute;t của cha mẹ (parental supervision)</em> đầy đủ, điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể ảnh hưởng ti&ecirc;u cực đến <em>sức khỏe tinh thần (mental well-being) </em>v&agrave; c&aacute;c gi&aacute; trị của c&aacute;c em.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: T</strong>r&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y g&acirc;y ra</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin chắc rằng những lợi &iacute;ch của sự ph&aacute;t triển n&agrave;y vượt xa những lo ngại n&agrave;y.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LeX1d74K2oszJwxVwgLlOlubghg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkeldoaoMokRxRxYECWljT3dg3g\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Một lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể l&agrave; việc c&oacute; nhiều tự do hơn cho ph&eacute;p trẻ em tự đưa ra lựa chọn của m&igrave;nh v&agrave; <em>học hỏi từ kinh nghiệm của bản th&acirc;n (learn from their experiences),</em> gi&uacute;p c&aacute;c em ph&aacute;t triển<em> t&iacute;nh độc lập (independence)</em> v&agrave; <em>khả năng tự lập (self-reliance)</em>.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkeldoaoMokRxRxYECWljT3dg3g\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Impact: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y trao quyền cho c&aacute;c em trở n&ecirc;n c&oacute; khả năng giải quyết vấn đề tốt hơn <em>một c&aacute;ch tự chủ (on their own)</em> m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng cần phụ thuộc li&ecirc;n tục v&agrave;o người lớn, đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một kỹ năng thiết yếu cho cuộc sống c&aacute; nh&acirc;n v&agrave; nghề nghiệp tương lai của c&aacute;c em.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OF6RdYATso7Jyzxkud3lxrSRgLc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx3Ud3ZRuojDvLxy5F2lhSbjgaf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2: </strong>Khi được tự do<em> theo đuổi sở th&iacute;ch của m&igrave;nh (pursue their interests)</em>, trẻ em c&oacute; thể kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; đam m&ecirc; v&agrave; t&agrave;i năng của bản th&acirc;n một c&aacute;ch tự nhi&ecirc;n hơn.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx3Ud3ZRuojDvLxy5F2lhSbjgaf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> C&aacute;c em c&oacute; thể kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; những sở th&iacute;ch như hội họa, lập tr&igrave;nh, hoặc thể thao m&agrave; c&aacute;c em thực sự y&ecirc;u th&iacute;ch thay v&igrave; chỉ l&agrave;m những g&igrave; cha mẹ lựa chọn cho m&igrave;nh. <em>Sự tự do lựa chọn (freedom of choice)</em> n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng chỉ nu&ocirc;i dưỡng t&iacute;nh s&aacute;ng tạo m&agrave; c&ograve;n gi&uacute;p trẻ em ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; thức bản sắc v&agrave; mục đ&iacute;ch sống mạnh mẽ hơn ngay từ khi c&ograve;n nhỏ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2ludgo4OokMAXxI7XBlboYqgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZJ5diZ6OoQkltxv3m6lz9I7g5b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">certain risks related to discipline and online safety <em>(một số rủi ro li&ecirc;n quan đến kỷ luật v&agrave; an to&agrave;n trực tuyến)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZJ5diZ6OoQkltxv3m6lz9I7g5b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">fostering independence and encouraging creative exploration <em>(th&uacute;c đẩy t&iacute;nh độc lập v&agrave; khuyến kh&iacute;ch kh&aacute;m ph&aacute; s&aacute;ng tạo)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3394,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>In many parts of the world, children today enjoy considerably more freedom compared to previous generations. Although this trend may lead to certain drawbacks, I believe it is largely a positive development overall.</p>",
            "question_id": 42729,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3395,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p><strong>Admittedly, granting children greater freedom can result in some negative consequences regarding discipline and safety. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Without proper guidance and strict rules, children may struggle to develop self-discipline and a sense of responsibility. This can lead to difficulties following rules at school or respecting authority figures like teachers and parents, which could hinder their ability to function well in structured environments.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, with more freedom, especially in the digital realm, children can easily access harmful or age-inappropriate material online. For instance, they might encounter violent videos or cyberbullying on social media platforms without adequate parental supervision, which could negatively affect their mental well-being and values.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 42729,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3396,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p><strong>However, I am convinced that the advantages of this development far outweigh these concerns. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">One significant benefit is that greater freedom allows children to make their own choices and learn from their experiences, helping them develop independence and self-reliance. This empowers them to become more capable of solving problems on their own without constantly relying on adults, which is an essential skill for their future personal and professional lives. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, when given the liberty to pursue their interests, children can discover their passions and talents more naturally. They might explore hobbies like painting, coding, or sports that they genuinely enjoy rather than only doing what parents choose for them. This freedom of choice not only nurtures creativity but also helps children develop a stronger sense of identity and purpose from an early age.</span></p>",
            "question_id": 42729,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3397,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, even though providing children with more freedom may involve certain risks related to discipline and online safety, I believe the benefits in terms of fostering independence and encouraging creative exploration are far more significant.</p>",
